note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note util.om: the one cudapp-smi control whose params exceed native/nvrm/context.om's 16384-byte nvpar.
note Appended after context.om and before rm.om. The control header goes through context.om's nvhdr;
note the params live in smbig. Layout: open-gpu-kernel-modules 580.173.02 (commit 20e4e6e1),
note src/common/sdk/nvidia/inc/ctrl/ctrl2080/ctrl2080perf.h:447-592 and ctrl2080gpumon.h:40.
note   545267862 NV2080_CTRL_CMD_PERF_GET_GPUMON_PERFMON_UTIL_SAMPLES_V2 0x20802096, 55888-byte params:
note   type u8 @0, bufSize u32 @4, count u32 @8, tracker u32 @12, 72 samples of 776 bytes @16.
note devcall with 55888 bytes needs the devcall bound of aien-dev/omega-mv#1042 (draft PR #1048):
note omc e5b32567 traps 3 above 16383 bytes, so this unit is pinned to the #1048 candidate compiler.

global smbig uchar 55888

fn sbzero to void
for i ulong len smbig
put smbig i 0
end
end

fn sbput off ulong v uint to void
for i ulong 4
put smbig add off i uchar and shr v mul i 8 255
end
end

fn sbget off ulong to uint
v = uint 0
for i ulong 4
v = or v shl uint get smbig add off i mul i 8
end
ret v
end

fn sbg64 off ulong to ulong
v = ulong 0
for i ulong 8
v = or v shl ulong get smbig add off i mul i 8
end
ret v
end

note Subdevice control with smbig as params; result as nvctrl (false: nverr or the status at header 28).
fn nvbig cmd uint n ulong to bool
nhzero
nhput 0 get nvobj 0
nhput 4 get nvobj 2
nhput 8 cmd
r = devcall get nvfd 0 uint 3223340586 nvhdr 0 32 smbig 0 n
ret nvos r nhget 28
end
